comment: Saccades are rapid eye movements that align the fovea with the target.
synonym: "Slow eye movements" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Slow saccades" EXACT []
synonym: "Slow visual tracking" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
