[Term]
id: HP:0001055
name: Erysipelas
def: "Increased susceptibility to erysipelas, as manifested by a medical history of repeated episodes of erysipelas, which is a superficial infection of the skin, typically involving the lymphatic system." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
