id: HP:0001836
name: Camptodactyly of toe
def: "Camptodactyly is a painless flexion contracture of the proximal interphalangeal (PIP) joint that is usually gradually progressive. This term refers to camptodactyly of one or more toes." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
