def: "Any structural abnormality of the telencephalon, which is also known as the cerebrum." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Abnormality of the cerebrum" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of the telencephalon" EXACT []
