synonym: "Myoclonus seizures" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0032677 ! Generalized-onset motor seizure
is_a: HP:0032794 ! Myoclonic seizure

[Term]
id: HP:0002126
name: Polymicrogyria
def: "Polymicrogyria is a congenital malformation of the cerebral cortex characterized by abnormal cortical layering (lamination) and an excessive number of small gyri (folds)." [http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q90573458, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:24888723]
comment: Polymicrogyria, one of the most common malformations of cortical development, is characterized histologically by the appearance of an excessive number of small cortical folds, often fused together, with disordered cortical lamination.
synonym: "More grooves in brain" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
is_a: HP:0002536 ! Abnormal cortical gyration

