[Term]
id: HP:0003106
name: Subperiosteal bone resorption
def: "Loss of bone mass occurring beneath the periosteum (the periosteum is the connective-tissue membrane that surrounds all bones except at the articular surfaces). This process may create a serrated and lace-like appearance in periosteal cortical bone." [PMID:24849102]
