id: HP:0003641
name: Hemoglobinuria
def: "The presence of free hemoglobin in the urine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: If, following hemolysis, haptoglobins (hemoglobin-binding proteins) are saturated, then free hemoglobin appears in the urine.
