alt_id: HP:0004731
def: "An abnormality of the renal collecting system." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Abnormal collecting system" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of the renal collecting system" EXACT []
synonym: "Renal collecting system anomalies" EXACT []
