def: "Episodes of atrial fibrillation that typically last for several hours up to one day and terminate spontaneously." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:30571060]
synonym: "Atrial fibrillation, paroxysmal" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
