[Term]
id: HP:0005534
name: Transient myeloproliferative syndrome
def: "A unique clonal neoplastic disorder that is linked to trisomy 21, is restricted to neonatal period, and spontaneously regresses. It often has characteristics of megakaryocytic lineage and is associated with GATA1 mutations in myeloblasts." [PMID:22966823]
