[Term]
id: HP:0005557
name: Abnormal zygomatic arch morphology
def: "An abnormality of the zygomatic arch, also known as the cheek bone." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The zygomatic arch is formed by the zygomatic process of temporal bone and the temporal process of the zygomatic bone.
