def: "Underdevelopment of the external ear." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:19152421, PMID:3270622]
comment: The definitions of microtia follow a widely used, surgically based, classification of ear anomalies outlined by Weerda 1988. As microtia indicates at least both decreased length and width, and in more severe forms it includes abnormal shape of structures, all forms are acknowledged to be bundled terms, but are retained here because they are well established.
