[Term]
id: HP:0009700
name: Finger symphalangism
alt_id: HP:0006187
alt_id: HP:0006258
alt_id: HP:0009773
alt_id: HP:0009849
alt_id: HP:0009872
def: "An abnormal union between bones or parts of bones of the fingers. The synonymous term \"symphalangism of the hand\" may be translated as fusions of bones of varying digree, that involve at least one phalangeal bone of the hand. If bony fusions are referred to as \"Symphalangism\" the fusion occurs in a proximo-distal axis. Fusions of bones of the fingers in a radio-ulnar axis are referred to as \"bony\" Syndactyly." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154, PMID:10627733]
synonym: "Fused finger bones" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Symphalangism of the hand" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Synostosis involving bones of the fingers" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0004278 ! Synostosis involving bones of the hand
is_a: HP:0005918 ! Abnormal finger phalanx morphology
is_a: HP:0100262 ! Synostosis involving digits
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
property_value: terms:date "2009-01-30T04:12:24Z" xsd:dateTime

