[Term]
id: HP:0009896
name: Abnormal antitragus morphology
def: "An abnormality of the antitragus, which is a small tubercle opposite to the tragus of the ear. The antitragus and the tragus are separated by the intertragic notch." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
is_a: HP:0000377 ! Abnormal pinna morphology
