def: "Anisocoria, or unequal pupil size, may represent a benign physiologic variant or a manifestation of disease." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Pathologic anisocoria can reflect an abnormality of the musculature of the iris or of the sympathetic or prasympathetic innervation of the iris.
