[Term]
id: HP:0010022
name: Pseudoepiphysis of the 1st metacarpal
def: "The epiphysis of the first metacarpal is localized at the proximal end of the metacarpal bone although an accessory epiphysis may be located at the distal end of the metacarpal." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This feature can be seen for example in Holt-Oram Syndrome.
