property_value: terms:date "2009-10-22T02:53:19Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0010588
name: Premature epimetaphyseal fusion
def: "Stop of growth at the epiphyseal plate the hyaline cartilage plate in the metaphysis at each end of a long bone, at an earlier than normal age, resulting in growth arrest and shortening of the involved bone." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:12624140]
comment: The epiphysis is the rounded end of a long bone, at its joint with adjacent bone.
synonym: "Premature closure of epiphyses" EXACT []
