def: "Mirror image duplication of digits affecting the hands only." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
synonym: "Mirror image duplication of fingers" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0001161 ! Hand polydactyly
is_a: HP:0010689 ! Mirror image polydactyly
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
property_value: terms:date "2010-03-05T05:05:05Z" xsd:dateTime

