property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2010-07-02T09:30:43Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0010808
name: Protruding tongue
def: "Tongue extending beyond the alveolar ridges or teeth at rest." [PMID:19125428]
comment: Protruding tongue may or may not be associated with a Large tongue, and that finding should be assessed and coded separately.
synonym: "Lingual prolapse" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Lingual prominence" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Lingual protrusion" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Prolapse of tongue" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
