property_value: terms:date "2011-10-18T02:12:41Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0011153
name: Focal motor seizure
def: "A type of focal-onset seizure characterized by a motor sign as its initial semiological manifestation." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:jalbers, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1735-8178, PMID:11580774, PMID:28276060, PMID:28276064]
comment: A motor onset seizure involves motor activity (movement) and may be due to either an increase or decrease in contraction in a muscle or group of muscles. Depending on the muscle groups involved and the way they are affected, the movement features of a motor onset seizure may be simple or more complex.
synonym: "Focal motor seizures" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Localised motor seizure" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Localised motor seizures" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Localized motor seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Localized motor seizures" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Partial motor seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Partial motor seizures" EXACT plural_form [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Segmental motor seizure" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0007359 ! Focal-onset seizure
is_a: HP:0020219 ! Motor seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2011-10-18T02:33:17Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0011154
name: Focal autonomic seizure
alt_id: HP:0011164
def: "An autonomic seizure is a type of focal non-motor seizure characterized by alteration of autonomic nervous system function as the initial semiological feature." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:jalbers, PMID:28276060, PMID:28276064]
comment: Focal seizures with a subjective or objectively documented alteration of autonomic nervous system function at onset, involving but not limited to, cardiovascular, pupillary, gastrointestinal, sudomotor, vasomotor and thermoregulatory functions. Focal autonomic seizure is not a child of Epileptic aura (HP:0033348) as many Focal autonomic seizures are not purely subjective (required to be called an aura).
synonym: "Focal autonomic seizures" EXACT plural_form []
is_a: HP:0032679 ! Focal non-motor seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2011-10-18T02:23:31Z" xsd:dateTime

