def: "Increase posterolateral protrusion of the tragus." [PMID:19152421]
synonym: "Enlarged tragus" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Hyperplastic tragus" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
