[Term]
id: HP:0011273
name: Anisocytosis
def: "Abnormally increased variability in the size of erythrocytes." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Unequal size of red blood cells" EXACT layperson [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/anisocytosis, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
