property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2012-03-17T07:05:40Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0011429
name: Short fetal humerus length
def: "A short humerus length is defined as a length below the 2.5th percentile for gestational age or as a measurement less than 0.9 of that predicted by the measured biparietal diameter. The humerus should be measured with the bone perpendicular to the ultrasound beam and with epiphyseal cartilages visible but not included in the measurement (PMID:16100637)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:16100637]
