[Term]
id: HP:0011724
name: Uhl's anomaly
def: "Uhl anomaly of the right ventricle refers to the almost complete absence of right ventricular myocardium, normal tricuspid valve, and preserved septal and left ventricular myocardium." [PMID:10859296, PMID:16322929]
