[Term]
id: HP:0011728
name: Elbow clonus
def: "Clonus at the elbow joint, i.e., an exaggerated phasic stretch reflex characterized by repetitive, rhythmic contractions at the elbow, generated by rapid passive stretch at the elbow joint." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
is_a: HP:0002169 ! Clonus
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
