def: "A type of pituitary adenoma that is of unknown cellular origin and that lacks immunocytochemical or fine structural markers. Null cell adenomas are not associated with hormone excess." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0538-4547]
synonym: "Clinically silent pituitary adenoma" EXACT []
synonym: "Hormonally silent pituitary adenoma" EXACT []
synonym: "Non-functional pituitary adenoma" EXACT []
synonym: "Silent pituitary adenoma" EXACT []
