[Term]
id: HP:0011963
name: Pretesticular azoospermia
def: "Absence of any measurable level of sperm in his semen, due to a hypothalamic or pituitary abnormality diagnosed with hypo-gonadotropic-hypogonadism. The diagnosis is made on the basis of low LH and FSH levels and low or normal testosterone levels." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:20514278]
is_a: HP:0000027 ! Azoospermia
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
