[Term]
id: HP:0012032
name: Lipoma
def: "Benign neoplasia derived from lipoblasts or lipocytes of white or brown fat. May be angiomatous or hibernomatous." [MPATH:417]
synonym: "Fatty lump" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Noncancerous fatty lump" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
