property_value: terms:date "2012-07-27T01:33:13Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0012033
name: Sacral lipoma
def: "Presence of a lipoma in the region of the sacrum." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:30264029]
comment: For an example, see Figure 1 of PMID:30264029.
is_a: HP:6000590 ! Spinal lipoma
