def: "An anomaly of the addition of sialic acids to N-linked glycans." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The most common sialic acids is N-acetylneuraminic acid (Neu5Ac).
is_a: HP:0012347 ! Abnormal protein N-linked glycosylation
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2013-09-15T10:08:34Z" xsd:dateTime

