[Term]
id: HP:0012366
name: Basilar invagination
def: "Projection of the tip of the dens more than 5 mm above a line joining the hard palate to the posterior lip of the foramen magnum (Chamberlain's line) or the tip of the dens is greater than 7 mm above McGregor's line (the back of the hard palate to the lowest point of the occipital squama)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:10084535]
is_a: HP:0000932 ! Abnormal posterior cranial fossa morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
