id: HP:0012420
name: Meconium stained amniotic fluid
def: "Amniotic fluid containing the earliest stools of a mammalian infant." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Meconium may be expelled into the amniotic fluid before birth in response to fetal distress. If meconium is aspirated by the fetus, it may lead to meconium aspiration syndrome.
