name: Impaired specific antibody response
def: "Reduced ability of the immune system to produce targeted, protective antibodies (immunoglobulins) against specific pathogens or vaccines in the setting of normal or near-normal serum levels of total IgG, IgA, and IgM and normal absolute counts of B cells and T cells." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:17100769]
comment: Decreased circulating concentration of specific antibodies
synonym: "Abnormal specific antibody response" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased circulating level of specific antibodies" EXACT []
