[Term]
id: HP:0012489
name: Suprasellar arachnoid cyst
def: "An arachnoid cyst that progressively enlarges from an abnormality in the membrane of Liliequist or in the interpeduncular cistern, and typically, expands from the prepontine space, displacing the floor of the third ventricle upwards, the pituitary stalk and optic chiasm upwards and forwards, and the mammillary bodies upwards and backwards." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:21586175]
comment: As the cyst increases in size it fills and occludes the third ventricle, and distorts and blocks the aqueduct, which finally results in hydrocephalus.
is_a: HP:0010576 ! Intracranial cystic lesion
is_a: HP:0100702 ! Arachnoid cyst
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2013-11-29T09:11:20Z" xsd:dateTime

