def: "Tremulousness (trembling) of the lens of the eye." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:5472193]
comment: Phacodonesis results from lesions of some or most of the zonular fibers are broken.
synonym: "Phacodonesis" EXACT []
synonym: "Trembling eye lens" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
is_a: HP:0000517 ! Abnormal lens morphology
