comment: Glucose uptake measured with FDG-PET is a marker of neuronal metabolic activity, thus this sign indicates reduced metabolic activity in the thalamus.
is_a: HP:0012658 ! Abnormal brain FDG positron emission tomography
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2014-02-15T11:35:25Z" xsd:dateTime

