[Term]
id: HP:0012781
name: Mid-frequency hearing loss
def: "A type of hearing impairment affecting primarily the middle frequencies of sound (1000 Hz to 3000 Hz)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
is_a: HP:0000365 ! Hearing impairment
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2014-04-08T11:04:07Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0012782
name: Perilobar nephrogenic rest
def: "A type of nephrogenic rest associated with multiple lesions in the periphery of the renal lobe." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:20301471]
comment: Perilobar nephrogenic rests are associated with Beckwith-Wiedemann syndrome (BWS) and hemi-hyperplasia.
synonym: "Perilobar nephrogenic rests" EXACT plural_form []
is_a: HP:0100880 ! Nephrogenic rest
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2014-04-20T03:23:16Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0012783
name: Intralobar nephrogenic rest
def: "A type of nephrogenic rest usually representing single lesions within the renal lobe, renal sinus, or calyceal walls." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:20301471]
comment: Intralobar nephrogenic rests are associated WAGR (Wilms tumor-aniridia-genital anomalies-retardation) syndrome and Denys-Drash syndrome (DDS).
synonym: "Intralobar nephrogenic rests" EXACT plural_form []
is_a: HP:0100880 ! Nephrogenic rest
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2014-04-20T03:24:35Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0012784
name: Perinephritis
def: "Inflammation of the connective and adipose tissues surrounding the kidney." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
is_a: HP:0000123 ! Nephritis
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2014-04-20T03:32:07Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0012785
name: Flexion contracture of finger
def: "Chronic loss of joint motion in a finger due to structural changes in non-bony tissue." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Note that the term camptodactyly refers to a painless flexion contracture of the proximal interphalangeal (PIP) joint and not to a finger joint contracture in general.
synonym: "Flexion deformity of finger" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0034681 ! Finger joint contracture
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2014-04-20T04:09:34Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0012786
name: Recurrent cystitis
def: "Repeated infections of the urinary bladder." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:20639019]
comment: One definition of recurrent cystitis involves 3 or more diagnosed cystitis episodes (ICD-9 codes 595.0, 595.9, 597.81, 599.0 with episodes separated by 30 days or more) within a 12-month period or 2 episodes within 6 months.
synonym: "Recurrent bladder infections" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
is_a: HP:0000010 ! Recurrent urinary tract infections
is_a: HP:5210191 ! Unusual cystitis
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2014-04-22T09:18:06Z" xsd:dateTime

