id: HP:0012811
name: Wide nasal ridge
def: "Increased width of the nasal ridge." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:19152422]
comment: This feature should be assessed in a frontal view. There is no objective measure of width. This may give the impression of a Depressed nasal ridge, but this should be assessed in profile and separately coded. Marked widening of the nasal ridge may be difficult to distinguish from a Bifid nose.
