[Term]
id: HP:0012866
name: Abnormal sperm neck morphology
def: "A structural abnormality of the sperm neck." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:22198630]
comment: The neck of spermatozoa is the site of articulation between the head and tail, and comprises the sperm centriole and connecting piece.
