property_value: terms:date "2020-02-24T14:10:19Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0020218
name: Focal aware atonic seizure
def: "A type of focal atonic seizure during which awareness is fully retained throughout." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1735-8178, PMID:11580774, PMID:28276060, PMID:28276064]
is_a: HP:0020217 ! Focal aware motor seizure
