comment: Pectoralis major tear can be ascertained by ultrasound or MRI of the chest/upper arm.
synonym: "Pectoralis major rupture" RELATED []
is_a: HP:0011957 ! Abnormal pectoral muscle morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2026-02-26T11:34:59Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0020336
name: Increased urinary 18-oxocortisol level
def: "The amount of 18-oxocortisol in the urine, normalized for urine concentration, is above the upper limit of normal." []
comment: Increased levels of urinary 18-oxocortisol may be observed in type 1 familial hyperaldosteronism, type I familial primary hyperaldosteronism, and other conditions. {xref="PMID:29763159", xref="PMID:25776074", xref="PMID:25905293"}
