id: HP:0025174
name: Irregular septal thickening on pulmonary HRCT
def: "Thickening of the interlobular septa of the lungs as seen on a high-resolution computed tomography scan with an irregular appearance of the interlobular septa. THis feature is often associated with distortion of lung architecture." []
is_a: HP:0030879 ! Interlobular septal thickening
