[Term]
id: HP:0025192
name: Subtentorial periventricular white matter hyperdensity
def: "Areas of brighter than expected signal on magnetic resonance imaging emanating from the cerebral white matter that surrounds the fourth cerebral ventricle (which is located beneath the tentorium of the cerebellum)." []
