property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-18T15:30:58Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025287
name: Axial
def: "Applies to an abnormality that is situated in the central part of the body, in the head and trunk as distinguished from the limbs." []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-18T15:34:25Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025288
name: Excessive sleep
def: "A clinical phenomenon characterized by sleeping longer than what is typical or necessary for a person's age and context, or by recurrent episodes of sleep that intrude upon the waking hours. Excessive sleep is identified through self-reports or observations and may involve prolonged nighttime sleep, frequent daytime naps, or episodes of unintentional sleep." []
comment: Excessive sleep often occurs even when a person has had adequate nighttime sleep and may be associated with functional impairment, reduced alertness, or dissatisfaction with sleep.
synonym: "Prolonged sleep duration" EXACT []
synonym: "Sleeping too much" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0002360 ! Sleep disturbance
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2025-10-20T16:47:01Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025289
name: Cervical lymphadenopathy
def: "Enlarged lymph nodes in the neck." []
synonym: "Swollen lymph nodes in the neck" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0002716 ! Lymphadenopathy
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-18T15:40:35Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025290
name: Upper-body predominance
def: "Applies to an abnormality that affects the arms, trunk, head more than the legs." []
is_a: HP:0012838 ! Localized
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-18T16:11:12Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025291
name: Lower-body predominance
def: "Applies to an abnormality that affects the legs more than the arms, trunk, head." []
is_a: HP:0012838 ! Localized
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-18T16:12:27Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025292
name: Acral
def: "Applies to an abnormality that affects the distal portions of limbs (hand, foot) and head (ears, nose)." []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-18T16:15:24Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025293
name: Distributed along Blaschko lines
def: "Applies to an abnormality whose localization corresponds to the lines of Blaschko, which correspond to the lineage of epithelia cells. Blaschko lines are normally invisible but may become apparent with certain skin diseases and then can be seen to be distributed in lines horizontal to the body." [PMID:17061271]
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-18T16:16:24Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025294
name: Dermatomal
def: "Applies to an abnormality whose localization corresponds to the dermatomes, i.e., the nerve root distribution." [PMID:19772560]
comment: This distribution can be seen with certain skin findings such as shingles. The term radicular is used to describe a dermatomal distribution of nerve root pain.
synonym: "Radicular" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-18T16:17:51Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025295
name: Herpetiform
def: "Applies to an abnormality whose distribution and appearance resembles that of the grouped umbilicated vesicles seen in herpes simplex and herpes zoster infections." []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-18T16:19:13Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025296
name: Morbilliform
def: "Applies to an abnormality whose distribution and appearance resembles that of measles, i.e., maculopapular lesions that are red and roughly 2 to 10 mm in diameter and may be partially confluent." []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-18T16:20:14Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025297
name: Prolonged
def: "Applied to an abnormality whose duration is extended over a longer period of time than is expected or usual (e.g., prolonged fever lasts longer than one usually sees with an infection)." []
is_a: HP:0011008 ! Temporal pattern
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-18T16:26:30Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025298
name: Extended nighttime sleep
def: "Sleeping for a longer duration than usual during the night." []
synonym: "Long nighttime sleep" EXACT []
synonym: "Prolonged nocturnal sleep" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025288 ! Excessive sleep
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2025-10-20T16:49:06Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025299
name: Frequent napping
def: "Regular episodes of sleep that occur during the day outside of the main sleep period." []
synonym: "Frequent daytime naps" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025288 ! Excessive sleep
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2025-10-20T16:50:12Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025300
name: Malar rash
def: "An erythematous (red), flat facial rash that affects the skin in the malar area (over the cheekbones) and extends over the bridge of the nose." []
comment: This type of rash is seen in lupus erythematosus, but also in other diseases such as rosacea and seborrheic dermatitis.
synonym: "Butterfly rash" EXACT []
synonym: "Cheekbone rash" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0000988 ! Skin rash
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-20T11:59:38Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025301
name: Nocturnal
def: "Applies to an abnormality that occurs in or is exacerbated during the night." []
is_a: HP:0011008 ! Temporal pattern
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-20T12:30:06Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025302
name: Diurnal
def: "Applies to a sign, symptom, or other abnormality that occurs in or is exacerbated in the day time." []
is_a: HP:0011008 ! Temporal pattern
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-20T12:31:12Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025303
name: Episodic
def: "Applied to a sign, symptom, or other manifestation that occurs multiple times at usually irregular intervals. The occurrences are separated by an interval in which the sign, symptom, or manifestation is not present." []
comment: In our definition, episodic is synonymous with intermittent and recurrent. The term does not imply any particular temporal pattern of the recurrence.
synonym: "Now and then" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0031796 ! Recurrent
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-21T00:51:43Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025304
name: Periodic
def: "Applies to a sign, symptom, or other manifestation that recurs with a fixed time interval, i.e., the symptom-free periods are always of the same length." []
synonym: "Cyclic" EXACT []
synonym: "Cyclical" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0031796 ! Recurrent
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-21T00:55:09Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025305
name: Quotidian
def: "Applies to a sign, symptom, or other manifestation that is episodic with a fixed time interval of one day (24 hours)." []
is_a: HP:0025304 ! Periodic
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-21T00:57:17Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025306
name: Acute emergence over minutes
def: "Acute appearance of disease manifestations in a period of minutes." []
is_a: HP:0011009 ! Acute
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-21T01:00:35Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025307
name: Acute emergence over hours
def: "Acute appearance of disease manifestations in a period of hours." []
is_a: HP:0011009 ! Acute
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-21T01:01:25Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0025308
name: Acute emergence over days
def: "Acute appearance of disease manifestations in a period of days." []
is_a: HP:0011009 ! Acute
