[Term]
id: HP:0025350
name: Giant conjunctival papillae
def: "Conjunctival papillae with a diameter greater than 1 millimeter. They characteristically have flattened tops which sometimes demonstrate staining with fluorescein." [PMID:26278858]
is_a: HP:0030946 ! Conjunctival papillae
