[Term]
id: HP:0025513
name: Scleral rupture
def: "Breakage of the sclera." []
comment: Scleral rupture may occur following trauma or may be observed with some types of Ehlers Danlos syndrome and other disorders. The rupture may be hidden by an intact conjunctiva.
