def: "A structural anomaly in the fetal neck region. Terms in this subhierarchy are restricted to findings that can only be observed in the prenatal period. Other HPO terms can also be used to describe fetal phenotypes." []
is_a: HP:0025668 ! Abnormal neck morphology
is_a: HP:0034058 ! Abnormal fetal morphology
