def: "Any deviation from the normal concentration of amyloid beta 42 peptide in the cerebrospinal fluid (CSF). Amyloid beta is a peptide of 36-43 amino acids that is processed from the Amyloid precursor protein. ABeta40, which is 40 amino acids in length, is the shorter form." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2307-1226, PMID:29420472]
synonym: "Abnormal Abeta 40 level" EXACT []
