id: HP:0030018
name: Decreased female libido
def: "Diminished sexual desire in female." []
synonym: "Decreased female sex drive" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
is_a: HP:0030014 ! Female sexual dysfunction
is_a: HP:0046504 ! Decreased libido

[Term]
id: HP:0030019
