[Term]
id: HP:0030090
name: Abnormal muscle fiber merosin expression
def: "An anomalous amount of merosin in muscle fibers. Merosin is a basement membrane-associated protein found in placenta, striated muscle, and peripheral nerve." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:2185464]
synonym: "Abnormal muscle fibre merosin expression" EXACT uk_spelling []
is_a: HP:0030089 ! Abnormal muscle fiber protein expression

[Term]
id: HP:0030091
name: Absent muscle fiber merosin
def: "Lack of merosin protein in the muscle biopsy." []
synonym: "Absent merosin staining in muscle biopsy" EXACT []
synonym: "Absent muscle fiber laminin alpha 2" EXACT []
synonym: "Absent muscle fibre laminin alpha 2" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Absent muscle fibre merosin" EXACT uk_spelling []
is_a: HP:0030090 ! Abnormal muscle fiber merosin expression

[Term]
id: HP:0030092
name: Reduced muscle fiber merosin
def: "A reduced amount of merosin in muscle fibers. This feature is usually assessed by immunohistochemical examination of muscle biopsy tissue." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Reduced muscle fibre merosin" EXACT uk_spelling []
is_a: HP:0030090 ! Abnormal muscle fiber merosin expression

[Term]
id: HP:0030093
name: Abnormal muscle fiber laminin beta 1
def: "A deviation from normal of the amount of laminin beta 1 in muscle fiber tissue. Laminin 2 is a major component of the basal lamina of skeletal muscle cells. It is a heterotrimer composed of 3 chains: merosin (laminin alpha 2 chain), beta 1, and gamma 1." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:UToronto_htrang, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:9400354]
synonym: "Abnormal muscle fibre laminin beta 1" EXACT uk_spelling []
is_a: HP:0030089 ! Abnormal muscle fiber protein expression

[Term]
id: HP:0030094
name: Reduced muscle fiber laminin beta 1
def: "A reduced amount of laminin beta 1 in muscle fiber tissue. Laminin 2 is a major component of the basal lamina of skeletal muscle cells. It is a heterotrimer composed of 3 chains: merosin (laminin alpha 2 chain), beta 1, and gamma 1." []
synonym: "Reduced muscle fibre laminin beta 1" EXACT uk_spelling []
is_a: HP:0030093 ! Abnormal muscle fiber laminin beta 1

