[Term]
id: HP:0030142
name: Abnormal bowel sounds
def: "An anomaly of the amount or nature of abdominal sounds. Abdominal sounds (bowel sounds) are made by the movement of the intestines as they promote passage of abdominal contents by peristalsis." []
