def: "Pain in the jaw or ear induced by chewing or otherwise moving the jaw." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:12972467]
synonym: "Jaw pain while chewing" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
is_a: HP:0025323 ! Abnormal arterial physiology

[Term]
id: HP:0030165
name: Temporal artery tortuosity
