[Term]
id: HP:0030321
name: Abnormal vertebral artery morphology
def: "An anomaly of the vertebral artery, the major artery of the neck that originates from the subclavian artery and merges to form the single midline basilar artery in a complex called the vertebrobasilar system." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Abnormality of the vertebral artery" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0011004 ! Abnormal systemic arterial morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030322
name: Vertebral artery hypoplasia
def: "Underdevelopment of the vertebral artery." []
is_a: HP:0030321 ! Abnormal vertebral artery morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030323
