is_a: HP:0004311 ! Abnormal macrophage morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030327
name: Abnormal osteoclast count
def: "An anomaly in the number of osteoclasts in bone tissue, bone-resorbing cells that develop from macrophages. This finding can be observed by histological examination of bone tissue." []
