id: HP:0030748
name: Grade I preterm intraventricular hemorrhage
def: "Intraventricular hemorrhage that occurs in a preterm infant and that is restricted to subependymal region/germline matrix which is seen in the caudothalamic groove." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:25371784]
synonym: "Germinal matrix haemorrhage" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Germinal matrix hemorrhage" EXACT []
