def: "Reddish, brown opalescent discoloration of teeth in normal light." [PMID:21731282]
comment: This feature is characteristic of Congenital erythropoietic porphyria (CEP), an autosomal recessive disorder caused by mutation in the gene that codifies uroporphyrinogen-III synthase, leading to porphyrin accumulation in many tissues.
synonym: "Red teeth" EXACT []
