[Term]
id: HP:0030759
name: Adipocyte hypertrophy
def: "An increase in mean adipocyte cell size. This feature can be measured by determining the average cell diameter of adipocytes microscopically using abdominal subcutaneous adipose tissue obtained by biopsy." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:25148116]
