id: HP:0030938
name: Enteric intraneuronal nuclear inclusion bodies
def: "Aggregates of stainable substances (proteins) in the nuclei of enteric neurons." []
is_a: HP:0025029 ! Abnormal enteric neuron morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2016-12-05T13:25:36Z" xsd:dateTime

