[Term]
id: HP:0031006
name: Acroparesthesia
def: "A type of paresthesia (tingling, pins-and-needles, burning or numbness or stiffness) that occurs in the hands and feet and particularly in the fingers and toes." []
is_a: HP:0003401 ! Paresthesia
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
