def: "Abnormal response to calcium Ionophore (such as A23187) as manifested by reduced or lacking aggregation of platelets upon addition of the ionophore." []
synonym: "Impaired Ca ionophore-induced platelet aggregation" EXACT abbreviation []
synonym: "Impaired Ca2+ ionophore-induced platelet aggregation" EXACT abbreviation []
