id: HP:0031269
name: Abnormal CD25 upregulation upon TCR activation
def: "Any abnormality in the upregulation of CD25 on T cells after activation via the T cell receptor (TCR). CD25 is the alpha chain of the IL2 receptor. Ligation of the T cell antigen receptor leads to the induction of CD25 expression." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, PMID:12121224]
is_a: HP:0410035 ! Abnormal T cell activation
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2017-08-12T19:51:36Z" xsd:dateTime

