comment: Electron microscopy of mammalian cardiac and skeletal muscle tissues reveal mitochondria as individual organelles situated either in clusters beneath the sarcolemma (subsarcolemmal mitochondria) or in longitudinal rows within the contractile apparatus (interfibrillar mitochondria).
