def: "An abnormally decreased proportion of naive T cells relative to the total number of T cells." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:12133935]
synonym: "Decreased proportion of naive T cells" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased proportion of naive thymus-derived, alpha-beta T cells" EXACT []
synonym: "Reduced proportion of naive T cells" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0031396 ! Abnormal naive T cell proportion
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2017-09-03T12:53:09Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
