property_value: terms:date "2017-09-16T12:34:05Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0031435
name: Monotonic speech
def: "A speech pattern characterized by a persistently abnormal lack of tone in the voice. Monotonic speech is typically ongoing, lasting throughout the day, but may have a diurnal variation in the pattern, i.e. slower at specific times of the day." []
comment: Often accompanied by reduced variation of rate and rhythm.
synonym: "Flat speech" EXACT []
