[Term]
id: HP:0031438
name: Abnormal circulating sex hormone-binding globulin concentration
def: "Any deviation from the normal concentration of sex hormone-binding globulin in the blood circulation." []
comment: Sex hormone-binding globulin (SHBG, Gene ID: 6462) binds the three sex hormones estrogen, dihydrotestosterone (DHT), and testosterone. Reduction in the level of SHBG can result in an increased level of free (unbound, and therefore active) sex hormones.
synonym: "Abnormal sex hormone-binding globulin level" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025465 ! Abnormal circulating beta globulin concentration
