[Term]
id: HP:0031439
name: Abnormal circulating angiostatin concentration
def: "Any deviation from the normal concentration of angiostatin in the blood circulation." []
comment: Angiostatin is an internal fragment of plasminogen that specifically inhibits endothelial cell proliferation and migration, and by promoting endothelial apoptosis.
