[Term]
id: HP:0031638
name: Anomalous origin of the left anterior descending artery from the pulmonary artery
def: "The left anterior descending artery (LAD) branches off from the pulmonary artery." [PMID:27358682]
comment: Normally the left main coronary artery bifurcates into the left circumflex artery and the LAD.
