property_value: terms:date "2018-05-05T14:15:17Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0031841
name: Positive urine methadone test
def: "Detection of methadone or its metabolite 2-ethylidene-1,5-dimethyl-3,3- diphenylpyrrolidine (EDDP) in urine." []
comment: Methadone is an opioid drug that is used to treat severe pain or in the treatment of individiuals with opioid dependency.
