def: "Abnormally lax upper eyelid associated with tissue relaxation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0986-4123]
is_a: HP:0031880 ! Eyelid laxity
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2018-09-01T14:52:53Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0032035
name: Lower eyelid laxity
def: "Abnormally lax lower eyelid associated with tissue relaxation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0986-4123]
is_a: HP:0031880 ! Eyelid laxity
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
