[Term]
id: HP:0032050
name: Focal cortical dysplasia type Ic
def: "A subtype of focal cortical dysplasia type I that is characterized by abnormal radial and tangential cortical lamination." [http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q90573458, PMID:21219302]
is_a: HP:0032049 ! Focal cortical dysplasia type Ib
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
