id: HP:0032230
name: Cytoplasmic antineutrophil antibody positivity
def: "The presence of autoantibodies in the serum that react against proteins predominantly expressed in cytoplasmic granules of neutrophils." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7440-8864, PMID:14646155, PMID:24854381, PMID:27481040, PMID:28661185]
