def: "Subcortical heterotopia consisting of a bilateral and symmetric single continuous, undulating ribbon-like layer of gray matter located in the frontal, parietal and occipital lobes. It has no visible connection to the overlying cortex." [http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q90573458, PMID:24859200]
