[Term]
id: HP:0032641
name: Renal interstitial granulomas
def: "Interstital aggregates of histiciocytes, occasionally multinucleated with associated lymphoplasmacytic and occasionally eosinophilic inflammation. Organization can range from poorly-to-well defined and multinucleated giant cells may be present." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2356-950X, PMID:26413275]
synonym: "Renal interstitial granulomata" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0032581 ! Abnormal renal interstitial morphology
