id: HP:0032645
name: Renal interstitial mononuclear cell infiltration
def: "Presence of interstitial mononuclear leukocytes, i.e., white blood ceclls with a single round nucleus, including lymphocytes and monocytes but not including granulocytes (which have multilobed nuclei)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2356-950X]
is_a: HP:0032581 ! Abnormal renal interstitial morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
