[Term]
id: HP:0032646
name: Renal interstitial xanthogranulomatous inflammation
def: "Inflammation of interstitial tissues of the kidney consisting of foamy macrophages admixed with plasma cells, lymphocytes and neutrophils and occasional giant cells." [PMID:21526966]
