[Term]
id: HP:0032684
name: Focal aware cognitive seizure with auditory agnosia
def: "A focal cognitive seizure with auditory agnosia characterized by retained awareness throughout the seizure." [PMID:28276060]
is_a: HP:0032681 ! Focal aware cognitive seizure
is_a: HP:0032685 ! Focal cognitive seizure with auditory agnosia
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
