id: HP:0032697
name: obsolete Focal cognitive seizure with deja vu/jamais vu
def: "A focal cognitive seizure characterized by memory phenomena such as feelings of familiarity (deja vu) and unfamiliarity (jamais vu) as the initial semiological manifestation." [PMID:28276060]
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
