[Term]
id: HP:0032698
name: Focal cognitive seizure with conduction dysphasia/aphasia
def: "A focal cognitive seizure characterized by conduction dysphasia / aphasia as the initial semiological manifestation." [PMID:28276060]
comment: Conduction dysphasia / aphasia is the inability to repeat speech that is heard, due to failure to encode phonological information, in the setting of intact auditory comprehension (full understanding of what is heard), and fluent speech production (subject to paraphrasic errors).
is_a: HP:0032680 ! Focal cognitive seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2020-03-14T09:35:50Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0032699
name: Focal cognitive seizure with dysgraphia/agraphia
def: "A focal cognitive seizure characterized by dysgraphia / agraphia as the initial semiological manifestation." [PMID:28276060]
comment: Dysgraphia / agraphia is difficulty in writing. This seizure type is seen in seizures involving the dominant hemisphere parieto-temporal lobe region.
is_a: HP:0032680 ! Focal cognitive seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2020-03-14T09:37:17Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0032700
name: Focal cognitive seizure with left-right confusion
def: "A focal cognitive seizure characterized by left-right confusion as the initial semiological manifestation." [PMID:28276060]
comment: Left-right confusion is the inability to distinguish right from left. This seizure type is seen in seizures involving the dominant hemisphere parieto-temporal lobe region.
is_a: HP:0032680 ! Focal cognitive seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2020-03-14T09:39:16Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0032701
name: Focal cognitive seizure with anomia
def: "A focal cognitive seizure characterized by anomia as the initial semiological manifestation." [PMID:28276060]
comment: Anomia is the inability to name objects despite knowing what they are.
is_a: HP:0032680 ! Focal cognitive seizure
