id: HP:0032838
name: Neonatal unilateral epileptic spasm
def: "Neonatal unilateral epileptic spasm is a sudden flexion, extension, or mixed extension-flexion of predominantly proximal and truncal muscles that occurs at one side of the body." [PMID:28276064]
