[Term]
id: HP:0032940
name: Dissociation
def: "Disruption or detachment of certain aspects of one's normal psychological functioning typically involves a disconnection or separation from thoughts, feelings, sensations, memories, or one's sense of identity or reality." []
synonym: "Dissociative reaction" EXACT []
is_a: HP:5200216 ! Abnormal perceptual state
