[Term]
id: HP:0033004
name: Palmar warts
def: "Multiple verrucous lesions on the skin of the palm. These lesions are raised, have a thickened and rough surface, and may display prominent black dots (thrombosed capillaries). Palmar warts are caused by human papillomavirus (HPV)." [PMID:17210977]
