[Term]
id: HP:0033005
name: Plantar warts
def: "Multiple verrucous lesions on the skin of the sole of the foot. These lesions are raised, have a thickened and rough surface, and may display prominent black dots (thrombosed capillaries). Palmar warts are caused by caused by human papillomavirus (HPV)." [PMID:17210977]
is_a: HP:0100872 ! Abnormality of the plantar skin of foot
