comment: Farnesol is a farnesane sesquiterpenoid that is dodeca-2,6,10-triene substituted by methyl groups at positions 3, 7 and 11 and a hydroxy group at position 1. Its concentration in the blood circulation is increased in inherited squalene synthase deficiency.
