property_value: terms:date "2020-11-28T21:12:16Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0033287
name: Glomerular basement membrane lucencies
def: "Lucent zones within the glomerular basement membranes. May reflect remote/resolved deposits." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2356-950X, PMID:32866505]
comment: This feature can be observed on silver staining or electron microscopy.
is_a: HP:0033282 ! Abnormal glomerular basement membrane morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2020-11-28T21:13:41Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0033288
name: Glomerular basement membrane spikes
comment: Delicate, silver positive projections that extend at right angles from the glomerular basement membrane (GBM) out into the urinary space, creating an irregular GBM profile. {xref="PMID:32866505", xref="https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2356-950X"}
is_a: HP:0033282 ! Abnormal glomerular basement membrane morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2020-11-28T21:16:42Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0033289
name: Glomerular basement membrane wrinkling
def: "Irregular folding of the glomerular basement membrane with an intact lamina densa." []
comment: Wrinkling and folding of the glomerular basement membrane (GBM) without glomerular epithelial cell hypertrophy and hyperplasia (formerly known an ischemic type of collapse). The urinary space is patent. The wrinkling is generally made by small regular infoldings of the GBM.
is_a: HP:0033282 ! Abnormal glomerular basement membrane morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2020-11-28T21:18:45Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0033290
name: Glomerular subendothelial widening
def: "Expansion of the space between the glomerular endothelium and lamina densa by electron-lucent material." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2356-950X, PMID:21827618, PMID:32866505]
is_a: HP:0033282 ! Abnormal glomerular basement membrane morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2020-11-28T21:22:38Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0033291
name: Glomerular karyhorrhectic debris
def: "Apoptotic, pyknotic, and fragmented nuclei within the glomerulus." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2356-950X, PMID:32866505]
is_a: HP:0033267 ! Abnormal glomerular capillary lumen morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2020-11-28T21:25:04Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0033292
name: Glomerular fibrin thrombus
def: "An aggregate of coagulated blood containing fibrin, with or without entrapped cellular elements, within a glomerular capillary lumen." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2356-950X]
