[Term]
id: HP:0033799
name: Abnormal circulating sex hormone concentration
def: "Any deviation from the normal concentration of a sex hormone in the blood circulation" []
comment: Sex hormones are steroid hormones that include the androgens, estrogens, and progestogens.
synonym: "Abnormal circulating gonadal steroid concentration" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormal circulating gonadocorticoid concentration" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormal circulating sex steroid concentration" EXACT []
