name: Cortical radial artery lymphocyte hypercellularity
def: "A type of cortical radial artery endoarterial leukocyte hypercellularity due to the presence of increased number of lymphocytes in the lumen of cortical radial arteries." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2356-950X]
synonym: "Endoarterial hypercellularity within interlobular artery consisting of lymphocytes" EXACT []
