property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-03-12T13:31:04Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0034587
name: Nevus psiloliparus
def: "Nevus psiloliparus is a rare fatty tissue nevus that is a marker for encephalocraniocutaneous lipomatosis, a neurocutaneous syndrome with ocular and central nervous system anomalies. Clinically, nevus psiloliparus is often described as a congenital alopecia and appears as an irregularly shaped, circumscribed area of alopecia on the scalp. Histopathology demonstrates a near-complete absence of mature hair follicles with preservation of arrector pili muscles and mature adipocytes within the dermis." [PMID:32034785]
is_a: HP:0003764 ! Nevus
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-03-12T13:48:52Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0034588
name: Crypt hyperplasia
def: "Crypt hyperplasia denotes elongation of the length of the crypts of Lieberkuhn, a process that initially precedes villous atrophy. Elongation may be caused by expansion of the lamina propria as a result of the proliferation of stromal cells, an influx of inflammatory cells and tissue remodeling." [PMID:17021129]
is_a: HP:0025129 ! Abnormal small intestinal mucosa morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-03-12T13:52:40Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0034589
name: Increased circulating dehydroepiandrosterone-sulfate concentration
def: "Concentration of dehydroepiandrosterone-sulfate in the blood circulation above the upper limit of normal." [PMID:18252794]
comment: Dehydroepiandrosterone (DHEA) is produced in the adrenal glands and to a lesser extent by the ovaries and testes. DHEA is metabolized into DHEA-S in the adrenal glands and liver. Dehydroepiandrosterone-sulfate is a precursor of testosterone and estrogen.
