property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-03-19T13:29:12Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0034635
name: Muscle fiber granulofilamentous inclusion bodies
def: "The presence of inclusion bodies within the cytoplasm of muscle cells that contain a mxiture of granules and filaments." [PMID:19181099]
comment: See Figure 7B of PMID:19181099.
