[Term]
id: HP:0034666
name: Shoulder extension contracture
def: "Lack of the full expected passive range of flexion of the shoulder joint (Shoulder flexion puts the arms from a resting position at one's sides to straight above the head; thus, with shoulder extension contracture it is not possible to raise the arms above the head fully)." [PMID:31282072]
is_a: HP:0034665 ! Shoulder contracture
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-03-25T12:35:09Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0034667
