[Term]
id: HP:0034976
name: Absent pituitary stalk
def: "A developmental defect characterized by failure to develop of the pituitary stalk. The pituitary stalk, also known as the infundibulum or infundibular stalk, is the connection between the hypothalamus and the pituitary gland." [PMID:25250085]
comment: See Figure 1 and 2 of PMID:25250085.
is_a: HP:0034977 ! Abnormal pituitary stalk morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-07-16T12:39:21Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0034977
name: Abnormal pituitary stalk morphology
def: "A structural anomaly of the pituitary stalk, also known as the infundibulum or infundibular stalk, is the connection between the hypothalamus and the pituitary gland." [PMID:25654066]
is_a: HP:0000864 ! Abnormality of the hypothalamus-pituitary axis
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-07-16T12:45:14Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0034978
name: Interrupted pituitary stalk
def: "A developmental defect characterized by a discontinuity of the pituitary stalk. The pituitary stalk, also known as the infundibulum or infundibular stalk, is the connection between the hypothalamus and the pituitary gland." [PMID:25250085]
is_a: HP:0034977 ! Abnormal pituitary stalk morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-07-16T12:45:49Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0034979
name: Facial synkinesis
def: "Unintentional movement in one area of the face produced during intentional movement of another area of the face." [PMID:18470836]
comment: For instance, facial synkinesis may manifest as hypertonic contractures and synkinetic movements such as eye closure with volitional movement of the mouth or midfacial movement during volitional or reflexive eye closure.
is_a: HP:0034980 ! Synkinesis
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6670-9157
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-07-16T12:50:35Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0034980
name: Synkinesis
def: "Unintentional movement in one area of the body produced during intentional movement of another area of the body." []
is_a: HP:0100022 ! Abnormality of movement
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-07-16T12:53:26Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0034981
name: Exposure to birds
