id: HP:0430110
name: Positive bloodstream Cysticercosis antigen test
def: "Demonstration of an antigen specific to Cysticercosis in the bloodstream." [PMID:23265553]
comment: Cysticercosis, the infection with the larval stage of Taenia solium, is a cause of neurological symptoms including seizures.
is_a: HP:0430109 ! Positive bloodstream infectious agent antigen test
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
