property_value: terms:date "2021-05-02T20:58:15Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:4000054
name: Exanthem
def: "A widespread rash." []
comment: An exanthem may be caused by an infection or represent a reaction to a toxin or an immune response and may be accompanied by symptoms such as fever, malaise and headache.
is_a: HP:0000988 ! Skin rash
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2021-05-02T21:41:36Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:4000055
name: Intestinal inflammation
