[Term]
id: HP:5200020
name: Abnormal interest in others
def: "A deviation from typical perceived social engagement with other individuals given the social context. This may manifest as either an excessive interest (e.g., persistent preoccupation with another person, excessive attempts to engage) or an abnormal lack of interest (e.g., minimal or absent social curiosity) in others." [PMID:29914590]
