name: Sexsomnia
def: "Unintentional sexual behavior during sleep, such as masturbation, initiation of sex, or making sexual noises, is known as sexsomnia. Sexsomnia predominantly occurs during NREM sleep." [PMID:35388549, PMID:36866491]
