[Term]
id: HP:5201001
name: Complete unilateral cleft lip
def: "Unilateral cleft lip cleft that starts from the bottom of the upper lip and reaches the nasal cavity." [PMID:21331089, PMID:26171570]
comment: Please use this term only when the cleft lip is unilateral, ie occurring only on one side.
