[Term]
id: HP:6000062
name: Abnormal nipple discharge
def: "Abnormal fluid that seeps out of the nipple of the breast. Nipple discharge is categozied as lactational, physiologic, or pathologic." [PMID:36335926]
is_a: HP:0031094 ! Abnormal breast physiology
