property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-12-30T23:26:21Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:6000063
name: Hepatolithiasis
def: "The presence of gallstones within the intrahepatic bile ducts proximal to the right and left hepatic ducts." [PMID:26730152]
comment: Hepatolithiasis is benign in nature, but the prognosis is poor due to an association with recurrent cholangitis, biliary strictures, liver abscesses, and atrophy or cirrhosis of the affected liver. Hepatolithiasis is also a known risk factor for intrahepatic cholangiocarcinoma.
is_a: HP:0011040 ! Abnormal intrahepatic bile duct morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10033
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-12-30T23:26:21Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:6000064
name: Excessive eructation
def: "Abnormally frequent belching (expelling gas noisily from the stomach through the mouth)." []
synonym: "Excessive belching" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Excessive burping" EXACT layperson []
