[Term]
id: HP:6000076
name: Renal vasculitis
def: "Vasculitis (inflammation of blood vessels) in the kidney. Renal vasculitis can be observed with numerous disorders and presents clinically as rapidly progressive glomerulonephritis (RPGN) which is characterized by acute kidney injury (AKI), haematuria and proteinuria. Histological examination of the kidney reveals severe inflammation in the form of crescent formation, glomerular necrosis and vasculitis of small and medium sized vessels within the kidney." [PMID:31927782]
is_a: HP:0033835 ! Abnormal renal vascular morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/9413
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-12-30T23:26:21Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:6000077
name: Pancreatic islet beta cell iron deposition
def: "Accumulation of abnormally high amounts of iron in beta cells of the pancreas." [PMID:36882414]
is_a: HP:0012090 ! Abnormal pancreas morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/9232
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-12-30T23:26:21Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:6000078
name: Nasal hamartoma
def: "A hamartoma (tissue malformation consisting of an abnormal mixture of constitutive components) originating in the nose." []
is_a: HP:0010566 ! Hamartoma
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/9235
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
