property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2023-12-31T10:32:04Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:6000097
name: Spontaneous lens capsule rupture
def: "Breakage of the capsule of the lens. This is most often observed as a complication of lens surgery, but this term refers to lens capsule rupture not related to surgery or major trauma." [PMID:35198824]
comment: Spontaneous lens capsule rupture has been observed with Marshall syndrome.
