id: HP:6000349
name: Reduced tissue tissue AICAR transformylase activity
def: "Concentration or activity of 5-aminoimidazole-4-carboxamide ribonucleotide formyltransferase; EC 2.1.2.3) a in a tissue is below the lower limit of normal." [PMID:15114530]
is_a: HP:6000231 ! Abnormal tissue enzyme concentration or activity
