[Term]
id: HP:6000352
name: Tachyphagia
def: "Excessively rapid eating of food." [PMID:28011862, PMID:34487332]
comment: Although there is no universally accepted definition of what constitutes excessively rapid eating, one publication states that a meal lasting less than 15 minutes represents tachyphagia. The term also comprises bolting of food, which refers to eat food so quickly that one hardly chews or tastes it.
is_a: HP:0100738 ! Abnormal eating behavior
