[Term]
id: HP:6000364
name: Synovial cyst
def: "A fluid-filled sac or pouch-like mass that is a distention of a preexisting bursa in a joint, tendon sheaths or bursae. Synovial cysts contain synovial fluid and are lined by synovial membrane." []
is_a: HP:0025850 ! Abnormal synovial cavity morphology
