[Term]
id: HP:6000375
name: Reduced neutrophil myeloperoxidase activity
def: "Concentration or activity of myeloperoxidase (EC 1.11.1.7) as measured in neutrophils is below the limits of normal." [PMID:5796360]
is_a: HP:0034858 ! Abnormal leukocyte enzyme concentration or activity
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/8352
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
