[Term]
id: HP:6000385
name: Elevated circulating sCD163 concentration
def: "The concentration of sD163 (= soluble cluster of differentiation 163, = soluble CD163) in the blood circulation is above the upper limit of normal." []
comment: Soluble CD163 is considered to be a marker of alternatively activated (anti-inflammatory) macrophages.
