[Term]
id: HP:6000387
name: Anti-D-L antibody positivity
def: "The presence of Donath-Landsteiner (D-L) autoantibodies (immunoglobulins) in the serum." [PMID:34433582]
comment: This feature may be observed in paroxysmal cold haemoglobinuria.
synonym: "Anti-Donath-Landsteiner antibody positivity" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0030057 ! Autoimmune antibody positivity
