id: HP:6000437
name: Decreased circulating stearoylcarnitine concentration
def: "The concentration of stearoylcarnitine (C18:0) in the blood circulation is below the lower limit of normal." []
comment: Stearoylcarnitine, also known as acylcarnitine C18:0, is a fatty ester lipid molecule.
synonym: "Decreased circulating O-stearoylcarnitine concentration" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased stearoylcarnitine concentration" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased stearoylcarnitine level" EXACT []
