property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2024-03-02T10:34:04Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:6000443
name: Elevated blood mercury concentration
def: "The concentration of mercury in the blood is above the upper limit of a guidance value for total blood mercury concentrations that implies possible injurious effects." [PMID:26644501]
comment: Mercury testing may be considered in cases of high consumption of large predatory fish or exposure to mercury vapor .
is_a: HP:0410172 ! Blood xenobiotic
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/8437
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2024-03-02T10:34:04Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:6000444
name: Elevated blood cadmiun concentration
def: "The concentration of cadmium in the blood is above the upper limit of a guidance value for total blood mercury concentrations that implies possible injurious effects." [PMID:27486374]
comment: Cadmium is a toxic metal that can be released into the environment from human activities such as the use of cadmium containing batteries and phosphate fertilizers, incineration of electronic wastes and tobacco smoking.
is_a: HP:0410172 ! Blood xenobiotic
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/8437
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2024-03-02T10:34:04Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:6000445
name: Elevated thallium concentration
def: "The concentration of thallium in the blood is above the upper limit of a guidance value for total blood mercury concentrations that implies possible injurious effects." [PMID:30020612]
comment: Thallium is a tasteless, odorless, and water-soluble chemical element for which both accidental intoxication and criminal poisoning have been reported.
is_a: HP:0410172 ! Blood xenobiotic
