[Term]
id: HP:6000447
name: Decreased CSF asialotransferrin to transferrin ratio
def: "The concentration of asialotransferrin relative to that of transferrin in the cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) is below the lower limit of normal." [PMID:18519871]
is_a: HP:0025456 ! Abnormal CSF protein concentration
