[Term]
id: HP:6000602
name: Elevated urinary isovalerylglycine level
def: "The amount of isovalerylglycine in the urine, normalized for urine concentration, is above the upper limit of normal." [PMID:17850781]
comment: Isovalerylglycine (IVG) is an acyl glycine. The excretion of certain IVG is increased in isovaleric acidemia.
is_a: HP:0012073 ! Abnormal urinary acylglycine profile
