[Term]
id: HP:6000672
name: Ovarian cystadenoma
def: "A common, benign ovarian tumor that carries a good prognosis. The two most frequent types of cystadenomas are serous and mucinous cystadenomas whereas endometrioid and clear cell cystadenomas are rare." [PMID:30725635]
