name: Reduced erythrocyte galactokinase activity
def: "Activity or concentration of in the level of galactokinase (EC 2.7.1.6) in erythrocytes below the lower limit of normal." [PMID:7670469]
comment: Galactokinase catalyzes the phosphorylation of galactose to galactose-1-phosphate, the first step in galactose metabolism.
