id: HP:6000817
name: Melorheostosis
def: "Regions of sclerosing hyperostosis in the cortex of long bones, which might have a radiologic appearance of dripping candle wax." [PMID:31129707]
comment: The word Melorheostosis is used to denote a disease (OMIM:155950), but is also used a feature or phenotype, e.g., Buschke-Ollendorff syndrome (OMIM:166700).
