id: HP:6000838
name: Positive fecal cryptosporidium antigen test
alt_id: HP:6000909
def: "Cryptosporidium antigen present in stool. Tests include direct fluorescent-antibody (DFA), which detects intact organisms, and enzyme immunoassays (EIAs), which detect soluble stool antigens." []
synonym: "Positive stool Cryptosporidium antigen test" EXACT []
