id: HP:6000849
name: Spinal extradural arachnoid cyst
def: "Spinal extradural arachnoid cyst is a cyst in the spinal canal that protrudes into the epidural space from a defect in the dura mater." [PMID:24278289]
synonym: "SEDAC" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0002143 ! Abnormal spinal cord morphology
