[Term]
id: HP:6000858
name: Muscle extensor surface location
def: "Applies to an abnormality that is situated in extensor surface of an extremity." []
comment: For instance, in the upper extremity, this would refer to a lesion of the skin over the triceps as opposed to the biceps.
is_a: HP:0012838 ! Localized
