[Term]
id: HP:6000882
name: Anti-recoverin antibody positivity
def: "The presence of autoantibodies in the serum that react against recoverin. Recoverins are calcium-binding proteins primarily expressed in retinal rod photoreceptors and primarily involved in phototransduction." [PMID:38054667]
synonym: "Anti-retinal CAR antigen antibody" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0030057 ! Autoimmune antibody positivity
