[Term]
id: HP:6000938
name: Thumb hypoplasia grade 1
def: "Minor hypoplasia (developmental undergrowth) of the thumb, whereby all musculoskeletal and neurovascular components of the digit are present, just small in size (Blauth classification)." [PMID:24362256]
