[Term]
id: HP:6000939
name: Thumb hypoplasia grade 2
def: "A type of developmental undergrowth of the thumb, whereby all of the osseous structures are present (may be small), and there is metacarpophalangeal joint ulnar collateral ligament instability and thenar hypoplasia." [PMID:24362256]
synonym: "Hypoplasia of the thumb grade 2" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0009778 ! Short thumb
