[Term]
id: HP:6000940
name: Thumb hypoplasia grade 3A
def: "A type of developmental undergrowth of the thumb, whereby there are musculotendinous and osseous deficiencies with the carpometacarpal (CMC) joint intact. Absence of active motion at the metacarpophalangeal (MCP) or interphalangeal (IP) joint." [PMID:24362256]
synonym: "Hypoplasia of the thumb grade IIIA" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0009778 ! Short thumb
