[Term]
id: HP:6000943
name: Femoral osteopoikilosis
def: "Multiple multiple, small, well-defined radiodense foci of cortical-like bone in the medullary space parallel to the trabeculae located in the femur. The loci correspond to condensations of the lamellar trabeculae on histology." [PMID:30430046]
synonym: "Femoral slcerotic foci" EXACT []
synonym: "Sclerotic foci of the femur" EXACT []
