id: HP:6000956
name: Exuberant granulation tissue
def: "A manifestation of abnormal wound healing in which there is formation of excessive granulation tissue, with the granulation tissue rising above the level of surrounding skin and creating a raised, reddish, moist, and bumpy surface." [PMID:28492007]
synonym: "Hypergranulating wound" EXACT []
synonym: "Overgranulation" EXACT []
