[Term]
id: HP:6001164
name: Foot mass
def: "An abnormal enlargement or swelling localized to a foot." []
comment: The word mass is usually used at an early stage of the diagnostic workup before the precise nature of the swelling has been determined.
synonym: "Bump on foot" EXACT []
synonym: "Foot growth" EXACT []
synonym: "Lump on foot" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0001760 ! Abnormal foot morphology
