id: HP:6001290
name: Podocytic mitochondrial proliferation
def: "An ultrastructural abnormality of the kidney glomeruli characterized by an excessive number or abnormal aggregation of mitochondria in podocytes." [PMID:28117207]
comment: Typically observed by electron microscopy in patients with mitochondrial dysfunction-related nephrotic syndromes.
synonym: "Abnormal mitochondrial proliferation in podocytes" EXACT []
