id: HP:6001294
name: Tubular accumulation of uromodulin
def: "Accumulation of uromodulin within renal tubular cells or lumina." [PMID:31488840]
comment: This feature is typically observed in UMOD-related tubulointerstitial kidney disease.
is_a: HP:0032950 ! Abnormal renal tubular lumen morphology
