property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9042-0508
property_value: terms:date "2025-08-31T17:29:42Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:6001303
name: Pain on thumb extension
def: "An unpleasant sensation characterized by physical discomfort that is triggered upon extension (straightening) of the thumb." []
comment: Pain on thumb extension may be observed in extensor pollicus longus (EPL) tendonitis.
