[Term]
id: HP:6001317
name: Positive talar tilt test
def: "An abnormal result of the talar tilt test. This test assesses ankle ligament integrity, particularly the calcaneofibular ligament (CFL) and the deltoid ligaments. To perform the test, the foot is placed at an angle of 90 degrees with the leg, the calcaneofibular ligament is perpendicular and the anterior talofibular ligament is parallel to the long axis of the talus. Therefore, inversion in this position results in strain on the calcaneofibular ligament." [PMID:24995627, PMID:33543095]
comment: Post-traumatic laxity is defined as excessive joint range of motion beyond normal physiologic range of motion.
is_a: HP:0034674 ! Abnormal ankle physiology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/11152
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2025-08-31T20:35:02Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:6001318
name: Plantar ecchymosis
def: "A purpuric lesion that is larger than 1 cm in diameter and is located on the sole of the foot." [PMID:37692589]
comment: Plantar ecchymosis may be observed in Lisfranc Injury.
is_a: HP:0031364 ! Ecchymosis
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/11154
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2025-08-31T20:35:02Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:6001319
name: Prolonged exposure to axillary pressure
def: "History of prolonged compressive pressure in the axillary region." []
comment: Prolonged compressive pressure in the axillary region is a risk factor for compressive radial mononeuropathy.
synonym: "Prolonged axillary pressure" EXACT []
is_a: HP:4000110 ! Exposure history
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/11042
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2025-09-01T10:45:00Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:6001320
name: Lateral ankle pain
def: "An unpleasant sensation characterized by physical discomfort (such as pricking, throbbing, or aching) localized to the outer side of the ankle." []
is_a: HP:0030840 ! Ankle pain
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/11077
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
